From: CBOC-Vita <cboc-vita@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] 1.3: vglSetDrawCaches: fragment program memo per program, a program's unchanged uniforms named again in the same scene (the idea of the Galaxy port's 0014-vgx-draw-caches)

Written from the description of the Galaxy patch: its source was not at hand. Both are off until vglSetDrawCaches. No compile option and no shader compilation changes: the shader
cache identity stays the same. Differences that matter: a reused copy is valid for one scene, and for one turn of the uniform ring, so it never outlives what sceGxm guarantees.


